OL,3,AMacy's postpones Thanksgiving parade
OL,4,Adue to severe weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacy's has postponed its 100th annual
OL,7,FThanksgiving Day Parade in New York to
OL,8,FSaturday because of severe weather.
OL,10,FPreparations to hold the iconic holiday
OL,11,Fcelebration, known for its massive
OL,12,Fballoons that float among the city's
OL,13,Fskyscrapers, had already begun when the
OL,14,Fforecast for heavy rain and strong
OL,15,Fwinds on Thursday led to the delay.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
