OL,3,AMacy's postpones Thanksgiving parade
OL,4,Adue to severe weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last time the parade was suspended
OL,7,Fwas during World War Two, but it has
OL,8,Fnever been postponed due to weather. In
OL,9,F1971, Macy's decided to ground the
OL,10,Fballoons, which often feature beloved
OL,11,Fcharacters from pop culture, because of
OL,12,Fweather.
OL,14,FA powerful coastal storm is set to
OL,15,Faffect the New York area in coming
OL,16,Fdays.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
